# Guard: proptest seeds must persist under tests/proptest-regressions/ (committed and replayed).
# A root-level proptest-regressions/ is a misconfiguration. Do not add tests/proptest-regressions/
# here: those seeds are committed. A new failure seed must become a named #[test] next to its block.
/proptest-regressions/
